{"ID":"20240515131408-1s8d8ih","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131408-1s8d8ih","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131408-1s8d8ih\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141225-ehwffkf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141225-ehwffkf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:555,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141225-ehwffkf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:513,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:513\u0026#125;","title":"068","type":"doc","updated":"20240515141225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141225-ehwffkf","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 903px;","id":"20240515141225-ehwffkf","updated":"20240515141225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：２００８／０８／１３"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LL"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"約４０歲，正常"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/13"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因： 咳嗽，自述已歷一週，用力咳會咳出黃痰，曾服千金葦莖湯，今已無痰，只餘咳嗽。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１.月事如何：有血塊，無經痛，但經期間排大便會痛，月事提前。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２.睡眠：多夢，有時會醒。睡時身體覺冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３.手足：手熱，足趾冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４.大便：每日行，但不易出，有痔瘡感，屁多。眼看病人肚子過大。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５.小便：中黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６.口渴：口覺乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"７.喜熱飲冷飲：喜熱茶。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"８.嘔心脅痛：不嘔心，但吃飽後右脅會痛，病人自述有時會腳腫。又因提行李拉傷，造成心痛徹背。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：稍數、有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診： \n1.舌診：黃 乾\n2.眼診 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong strong","TextMarkTextContent":":"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 肝區圈紋，胰區好，腎區有反應\n3.穴診：陽陵泉略有壓痛。雙三陰交壓痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診：右耳膽區略有壓痛。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷：膽囊塞，肺中燥熱。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方：  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三錢  枳實三錢  黃芩三錢  炙甘草二錢  五倍子三錢  海金砂三錢  \n黃連二錢  白芍五錢  阿膠三錢(分三包烊盡)   葦莖三錢   冬瓜仁三錢   \n丹皮三錢  桃仁三錢  厚朴二錢  大黃三錢  槐花三錢  當歸二錢   \n赤小豆四錢  澤瀉五錢   豬苓三錢   茯苓四錢   \n拾付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n因右脅非持續痛，故非膽石，但正在形成中，故用柴胡、枳實、五倍子、海金砂等攻其未病。阿膠用以防止攻石引致出血。肺中仍熱，會產生黃膠痰，跑到胸腔造成心痛徹背，加上舌乾口渴，故用芩連，並續用葦莖、冬瓜仁、桃仁等清肺熱，去黃稠痰。因多屁，排便不暢，用小承氣湯。有痔瘡感，用槐花、當歸赤小豆治其下焦血分濕熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}